  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-skin-schierke",
      "text": "史尔基主题的 DSH Web UI 全界面皮肤。界面被重构为一册摊开的灵界田野志：侧栏是布面章节索引，Composer 是带页边线的观察条，消息、推理、代码和设置分别成为页边批注、脚注、墨块与附录页。"
    },
    {
      "section": "Interface states",
      "text": "| Light | Dark |\n| --- | --- |\n|  |  |\n\n| Active chat | No artwork |\n| --- | --- |\n|  |  |"
    },
    {
      "section": "Visual system",
      "text": "- Light: bone paper, faded sage, heather violet, umber ink\n- Dark: nocturnal paper, moonlit jade, muted violet, warm ivory type\n- Structure: open double-page spread, central gutter, vertical marginalia, chapter bookmarks\n- Components: ruled observation-slip Composer, marginal-note messages, footnote reasoning, ink-block code, appendix dialogs\n- Artwork: bundled local WebP contained in an illustrated folio plate; it fades during active chat and can be removed without erasing the skin's identity"
    },
    {
      "section": "Visual system",
      "text": "The visual rationale, rejected directions, identity axes, artwork policy, and comparison baseline live in [`design-brief.md`](design-brief.md)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add https://github.com/unpain/dsh-skin-schierke.git\n```\n\nSelect **Schierke Astral Grimoire** under `Settings > Skins`."
    },
    {
      "section": "Develop",
      "text": "```sh\npnpm install --config.auto-install-peers=false\npnpm assets:embed\npnpm build\nnode node_modules/vitest/vitest.mjs run\n\nThe generated character artwork is original project-local fan art. See `NOTICE` for provenance."
    }
  ],
